  "abstract_summary": "A pre-registration for a factorial study of where the cost of agent memory is paid. In a production agent-memory system (nox-mem, a self-hosted service consulted by six agents), memory loses to naive retrieval over the same raw prose once the context budget is equalised in code: 42.4% against 63.6% answer accuracy,...",
